==============================================================================
Bundled Third-Party Code
==============================================================================

This repository intentionally tracks exactly one file from the ohpm
dependency tree:

  oh_modules/.ohpm/@ohmos+calendar@2.1.4/oh_modules/@ohmos/calendar/
      src/main/ets/components/HmCalendar.ets

That file originates from the `@ohmos/calendar` package. The upstream package
metadata available in this repository does not declare a license, and the
package directory ships without a LICENSE or NOTICE file. Anyone redistributing
this repository should verify the licensing terms of `@ohmos/calendar`
directly with its publisher before reuse.

If you do not need that file, remove it from the repository rather than relying
on this notice.


